===Etymology 1===
Named after [[w:Euclid|Euclid]], who established the principles of [[plane geometry]].

====Adjective====
{{en-adj|-}}

# {{lb|en|geometry}} Adhering to the principles of traditional [[geometry]], in which [[parallel]] [[line]]s are [[equidistant]].
# Of or relating to [[w:Euclid|Euclid]]'s ''[[w:Euclid's Elements|Elements]]'', ''especially'' to [[Euclidean geometry]].

